{{apichanges|5.4.1|next=5.4.2|prev=5.4.0}}

== Breaking changes ==
* The [[CVar]] "realmName" is no longer queryable in-game with {{api|GetCVar}}. {{api|GetRealmName}} should be used to obtain the realm of the player.

== Bugs ==
* {{api|C_StorePublic.IsDisabledByParentalControls}} is protected (and called from <code>UpdateMicroButtons</code>, which is frequently called from execution paths tainted by addons).

